  "title": {
   "en": "Dokaburi no Erena hime"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "土かぶりのエレナ姫"
   },
   {
    "en": "Princess Elena"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A young noblewoman was living a traditional life until she suddenly regained memories of her past life. While other princesses dreamed of jewels and grand palaces, she longed to farm and work in the fields—a dream completely unsuited to her noble status.\n\nHowever, her father and fiancé strictly opposed her interest in agriculture, deeming it unfit for a lady of her standing. Unable to suppress her passion, she eventually sneaked out one day to visit a farm in secret.\n\nLittle did she know, this simple act would lead to a fateful encounter—one with Prince Louis, the man who would become the key to an entirely new chapter in her life!\n\nA unique journey blending fantasy, agriculture, and romance, where a noblewoman with a passion for farming finds herself on an unexpected path!"
  },
